encryption policy used for this integration. The encryption policy was
created automatically when you created the integration. For more
information, see Encryption policies
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/serverless-encryption.html#serverless-encryption-policies)
in the OpenSearch Service Developer Guide.

